      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bridgetown_ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in the early 1800s, Bridgetown grew within Green Township, Hamilton County, a governmental unit created in 1809.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bridgetown_ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1905 book Pioneer Annals of Greene Township frequently calls the area 'Bridgeton,' reflecting early naming habits.",
